cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you utilize the ATLAS-X database, similarity engine, or analysis pipelines in your planetary research, please cite it as below."
title: "ATLAS-X: Automated Terrestrial & Lunar/Martian Analog System"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-11-14"
abstract: "The Automated Terrestrial & Lunar/Martian Analog System (ATLAS-X) is an authoritative, multidisciplinary planetary database and analysis engine spanning Earth, the Moon, and Mars. It provides decoupled 4-axis multi-dimensional similarity matching, dual-tier engineering suitability masking, physical limit delta-vectors, and cross-body Uber H3 spatial harmonization compliant with NASA SPD-41a Open-Science standards."
